WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes may fit your schedule. It is not a shortcut around evidence.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A seller can promise an hour of meditation in twelve minutes. That is an advertisement.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Intensive meditation research did not test this product.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A preferred sound format may be convenient. Preference is not clinical proof.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Check privacy, terms and free options before choosing.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Follow the sources. Decide for yourself.
